<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - U.S. Surgical started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - U.S. Surgical started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Dain Bosworth analyst Sanjiv Arora said he started coverage of U.S. Surgical Corp with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the medical equipment company were off 3/8 to 39-1/8.</p>
<p>-- Arora cited the company's new products, improved margins and other factors.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
